{"id": "14-1622-2-8", "zh": "satthu、pitu 等词的词尾，在其他格尾前变为 āra。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "14-1623-2-21", "zh": "Satthāraṃ、pitaraṃ、mātaraṃ、bhātaraṃ、kattāraṃ、satthārehi、pitarehi、mātarehi、bhātarehi、kattārehi。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "14-1624-2-6", "zh": "为什么说“**在其他格尾前**”？", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "14-1624-7-16", "zh": "如 satthā、pitā、mātā、bhātā、kattā。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "14-1625-2-9", "zh": "201，163．在 naṃ 前可选。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "14-1626-2-9", "zh": "satthu、pitu 等词的词尾，在 naṃ 格尾前可选地变为 āra。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "14-1627-2-9", "zh": "Satthārānaṃ、pitarānaṃ、mātarānaṃ、bhātarānaṃ。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "14-1628-2-5", "zh": "为什么说“**可选**”？", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "14-1628-6-13", "zh": "如 satthānaṃ、pitūnaṃ、mātūnaṃ、bhātūnaṃ。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "14-1629-2-8", "zh": "202，164．satthu 的词尾也变为 a。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "14-1630-2-11", "zh": "satthu 这个词的词尾，在 naṃ 格尾前可选地变为 a。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "14-1631-2-11", "zh": "Satthānaṃ、pitānaṃ、mātānaṃ、bhātānaṃ、kattānaṃ。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "14-1632-2-5", "zh": "为什么说“**可选**”？", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "14-1632-6-15", "zh": "如 satthārānaṃ、pitarānaṃ、mātarānaṃ、bhātarānaṃ、dhītarānaṃ。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "14-1633-2-5", "zh": "用 ca 字，是为了把其他词也包括进来。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "14-1634-2-10", "zh": "203，162．在 sa 前变为 u，并且删去 sa。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "14-1635-2-14", "zh": "satthu、pitu 等词的词尾，在 sa 格尾前可选地变为 u，并且删去 sa。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "14-1636-2-12", "zh": "Satthu、satthussa、satthuno：（某物）被给予导师，或为导师所有。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "14-1636-13-22", "zh": "Pitu、pitussa、pituno：（某物）被给予父亲，或为父亲所有。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "14-1636-23-32", "zh": "Bhātu、bhātussa、bhātuno：（某物）被给予兄弟，或为兄弟所有。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "14-1637-2-4", "zh": "用 ca 字，是为了把第二项一并带上。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "14-1638-2-8", "zh": "204，167．sakkamandhātu 等词也是如此。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "14-1639-2-11", "zh": "sakkamandhātu 等词的词尾，在 sa 前变为 u，并且删去 sa。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "14-1640-2-7", "zh": "这位国王的财富，就像帝释与曼达多王（Sakkamandhātu）的一样。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "14-1640-8-15", "zh": "同样还有 kattu、gantu、dātu 等。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "14-1641-2-5", "zh": "为什么要重新设立这条规则？", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "14-1641-6-7", "zh": "是为了表明这里是必定的，而不是可选的。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "14-1641-8-9", "zh": "如 Sakkamandhātu。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "14-1642-2-4", "zh": "用 ca 字，是为了把第二项一并带上。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "14-1643-2-10", "zh": "205，160．在此之后，yo 变为 o。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "14-1644-2-11", "zh": "在替换音 āra 之后，所有的 yo 都替换为 o。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "14-1645-2-13", "zh": "Satthāro、pitaro、mātaro、bhātaro、kattāro、vattāro。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "14-1646-2-9", "zh": "用 tu 字，表示在其他词之后，yo 也变为 o。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "14-1646-10-17", "zh": "如 caturo janā（四个人）、gāvo（牛群）、ubho purisā（两个男人）。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "14-1647-2-10", "zh": "206，165．在此之后，smiṃ 变为 i。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "14-1648-2-10", "zh": "在替换音 āra 之后，smiṃ 格尾替换为 i。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "14-1649-2-15", "zh": "Satthari、pitari、mātari、dhītari、bhātari、kattari、vattari。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "14-1650-2-10", "zh": "再次用 tato 一词，表示在其他词之后，smiṃ 格尾也变为 i。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "14-1650-11-12", "zh": "如 bhuvi。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "14-1651-2-9", "zh": "207，161．nā 变为 ā。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "14-1652-2-10", "zh": "在替换音 āra 之后，nā 格尾替换为 ā。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "14-1653-2-15", "zh": "Satthārā、pitarā、mātarā、bhātarā、dhītarā、kattārā、vattārā。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "14-1654-2-9", "zh": "208，166．āra 在 i 前变为短音。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "14-1655-2-8", "zh": "替换音 āra 在后接 i 时变为短音。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "14-1656-2-13", "zh": "Satthari、pitari、mātari、dhītari、kattari、vattari。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "14-1657-2-8", "zh": "209，168．pitu 等词在 si 以外的格尾前（变为短音）。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "14-1658-2-9", "zh": "pitu 等词的替换音 āra，在 si 以外的格尾前变为短音。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "14-1659-2-16", "zh": "Pitarā、mātarā、bhātarā、mītarā、pitaro、mātaro、bhātaro、dhītaro。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "14-1660-2-8", "zh": "说“在 si 以外”，是为了表明后接 to 时（词尾）替换为 i。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "14-1660-9-16", "zh": "如 mātito、pitito、bhātito、duhitito。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "14-1661-2-11", "zh": "210，239．tayā、tayi 的 ta 可选地变为 tva。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "14-1662-2-9", "zh": "tayā、tayi 这两个词的 ta 音，可选地变为 tva。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "14-1663-2-9", "zh": "Tvayā、tayā、tvayi、tayi。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "14-1664-2-5", "zh": "为什么说“**这两个词的**”？", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "14-1664-6-9", "zh": "如 tuvaṃ、tavaṃ。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "14-1665-2-6", "zh": "以上是名词篇的第三章。", "confidence": 85}
